 I haven't been there before, but it's on my to-do list for after my tour with Frank Ocean ends. Can't wait to see them in person! Look at that snowy peak.\n[Image caption: a photo of a person on skis on a snowy mountain]\n[S9T15] (dia_id: D9:15)\n\nDave: Looks awesome! Have you ever tried skiing before? It looks like loads of fun!\n[S9T16] (dia_id: D9:16)\n\nCalvin: Haven't tried it before, but it does look like a lot of fun! I might give it a try once. So what's up with you, is anything new in your daily routine?\n[S9T17] (dia_id: D9:17)\n\nDave: Yes, Cal! I recently joined a rock band and have been practicing guitar. Look at this photo – it's us, the guys! \n[Image caption: a photography of a group of men playing instruments in a room]\n[S9T18] (dia_id: D9:18)\n\nCalvin: Playing guitar in a rock band is awesome, Dave! It will bring you a lot of emotions.\n[S9T19] (dia_id: D9:19)\n\nDave: Sounds good, Calvin! Good company and great music, lift the mood and bring a lot of positive emotions! I have to go now. I'll see you soon!\n[S9T20] (dia_id: D9:20)","text_sha256":"2e3101ff7e4e622b8854593e70d8f73319809dbcc69d20bd73ba44e3c0c68e7a","timestamp":"2023-06-21T15:15:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":867,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":13557,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":14424},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354